			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"斑目百兵衛"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721830101,
					"content": "這個是…種子？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830102,
					"content": "這是「鳴草」的種子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830103,
					"content": "你知道這種植物？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830104,
					"content": "唔，算是瞭解一些吧。我之前見過這種植物，也聽人講過它的奇異之處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830105,
					"content": "我記得…即使是在無風的情況下，這種植物也會隨著雷鳴之聲微微振動來著…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830106,
					"content": "種出來好看嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830107,
					"content": "如果光論外表的話…應該還是挺好看的吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830108,
					"content": "閣下是想試種一下「鳴草」嗎？但這附近可沒有什麼合適的土地…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830109,
					"content": "我有自己的土地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830110,
					"content": "是、是這樣嗎？不愧是閣下…連封地都已經拿到了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830111,
					"content": "那敢問閣下，您的封地是在…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830112,
						721830115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830112,
					"content": "不在稻妻內。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830113,
					"content": "喔！我也聽聞過閣下在蒙德和璃月的壯舉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830114,
					"content": "那樣的壯舉，獲賜封地也是正常，真不愧是閣下！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830120,
					"content": "#喂，{F#妳}{M#你}說的「土地」，不會是之前婆婆給我們的「塵歌壺」吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830121,
					"content": "那裡面，真的能種東西嗎？婆婆之前也沒有說過…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830122,
						721830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830122,
					"content": "回去問問吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830123
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830123,
					"content": "那好吧，我們回去問問婆婆好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830124,
					"content": "仙人，是很強的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830125
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830125,
					"content": "是、是這樣嗎？不過婆婆確實很強就是了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830126,
					"content": "那好吧，我們回去問問婆婆好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830115,
					"content": "在一盞壺裡。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830116,
					"content": "一盞…壺裡？閣下，您就別和我開玩笑了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830117,
					"content": "我也聽聞過閣下在蒙德和璃月的壯舉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830118,
					"content": "想必您的封地不是在璃月，就是在蒙德吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830119,
					"content": "唉，真不愧是閣下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "斑目百兵衛"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7218302,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7218302
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7218302",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7218302,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"萍姥姥"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 721830201,
					"content": "#咦？孩子們，{F#妳}{M#你}們是來找我的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830202,
					"content": "關於「鳴草」的種子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830203,
					"content": "#種子…喔，{F#妳}{M#你}是想要把這種子，種在「塵歌壺」裡嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830204,
					"content": "這倒也不是不行，畢竟那大小也是一片天地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830205,
					"content": "#只不過，{F#妳}{M#你}們今天只拿了這一包種子來，難道，{F#妳}{M#你}們就只打算種這一包種子嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830206,
					"content": "對、對喔！我們都不知道怎麼搜集種子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830207,
					"content": "這一包種子種完了之後，我們去哪裡找其他的種子呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830208,
					"content": "好了，好了，別著急。我這裡正好有一個我很多年前用過的小匣子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830209,
					"content": "我之前移栽花卉的時候，都是用這個小匣子裝的，裝在匣子裡的花，能夠保存很久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830210,
					"content": "而且，把花裝在匣子裡之後，這匣子還能化出幾枚花種…這樣，想要種植也很方便。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830211,
					"content": "雖然這匣子現在有些不太好用了…但至少還留著一些「化種」之能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830212,
					"content": "#唔…反正我老婆子現在也沒怎麼用過這匣子了…就把它送給{F#妳}{M#你}們吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830213,
					"content": "你們無論是想種些花花草草，還是想種點作物，這匣子應該都能派上些用場。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830214,
					"content": "謝謝婆婆！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721830215,
					"content": "謝謝婆婆！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830216,
					"content": "#呵呵，不用這麼客氣，快點去試試看吧，但侍弄花草可不是件簡單的事，{F#妳}{M#你}們可要做好心理準備啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "萍姥姥"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830217,
					"content": "婆婆果然很強啊…但是在試那個匣子之前，我們還是先回去壺裡，試試種一下那個種子吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721830218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721830218,
					"content": "唔，真希望這種子能快點長大…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}